&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop competitive positioning content—battlecards, differentiation guides, objection handling&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run demo coaching sessions and weekly office hours&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate new Claude Code features into field-ready content rapidly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gather field feedback and track content effectiveness to continuously improve programs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
