&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Must be able to lift up to 50 pounds at times&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
