&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Looking for a new career to call home?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Our Cape-Atlantic County, New Jersey Offices are interested in a Licensed Practical Nurse who has a passion for skilled nursing! The ideal nurse has a drive for expanding their skills to join our Skilled Nursing team. We believe our clients and their families deserve the highest quality care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Pediatric and Adult Cases Available in Atlantic City, Ventnor, and Margate City, New Jersey!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In need of Evening and Overnight Nurses&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
